   <text:p text:style-name="P6">EIRC Technology Overview</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P7"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P8"><text:span text:style-name="T1">The Eclipse technology consists of resource preparation, image processing research focusing on facial detection, implementation of a face processing engine, and enrollment management. In this document, intellectual property will be marked by</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T2"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">IP</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5"> , and unique implementations of prior art will be marked </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6"></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7">Key</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5"> .</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P9"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P10">The <text:span text:style-name="T8">Eclipse Face Processing (EFP)</text:span> <text:span text:style-name="T8">E</text:span>ngine includes the following steps:</text:p>
   <text:section text:style-name="Sect1" text:name="Section1">
    <text:list text:style-name="L1">
     <text:list-item>
      <text:p text:style-name="P11">Image Acquisition</text:p>
     </text:list-item>
     <text:list-item>
      <text:p text:style-name="P11">Frontal Face Detection</text:p>
     </text:list-item>
     <text:list-item>
      <text:p text:style-name="P11">Facial Feature (eyes) Location</text:p>
     </text:list-item>
     <text:list-item>
      <text:p text:style-name="P11">Face Image Normalization</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="P11"/>
     </text:list-item>
     <text:list-item>
      <text:p text:style-name="P11">Face Vector Generation</text:p>
     </text:list-item>
     <text:list-item>
      <text:p text:style-name="P11">Casual Matching</text:p>
     </text:list-item>
     <text:list-item>
      <text:p text:style-name="P11">Image Output</text:p>
     </text:list-item>
     <text:list-item>
      <text:p text:style-name="P11">Face-based Analytics</text:p>
     </text:list-item>
    </text:list>
    <text:p text:style-name="P10"/>
   </text:section>
